    <bpmn:process id="W_W4601" name="W4601. VAS/Financial-Agency Strategy, Portfolio &amp; Footfall Model" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (VS-33); footfall/revenue goal; community need
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: One VAS/financial-agency strategy &amp; portfolio
Owner: Commercial / Store Ops (VS-07) / Finance Strategy
Participants: Insights (VS-44), Marketing (VS-14), Compliance (VS-22), Legal (VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W4601 — VAS/Financial-Agency Strategy, Portfolio &amp; Footfall Model</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4601_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4601_Lane1" name="Commercial">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4601_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4601_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4601_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4601_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4601_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4601_Start3" name="Strategy (VS-33); footfall/revenue goal; community need">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4601_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4601_Task4" name="Commercial/Store Ops set the VAS strategy &amp; portfolio (bills payment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Commercial/Store Ops set the VAS strategy &amp; portfolio (bills payment, remittance, e-money cash-in/out, mobile load), target stores (provincial/community), and the footfall/basket/commission model
Responsible (R): Commercial / Store Ops / Finance Strategy
Accountable (A): COO / CMO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4601_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4601_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4601_Task5" name="Commercial/Insights size the opportunity (footfall lift, basket-linkage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Commercial/Insights size the opportunity (footfall lift, basket-linkage, commission revenue, cost-to-serve) using VS-44/VS-13, and define success metrics
Responsible (R): Commercial / Insights / Finance Strategy
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4601_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4601_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4601_Task6" name="Commercial/Legal/Compliance validate the agency model (BuildRight as agent, not…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Commercial/Legal/Compliance validate the agency model (BuildRight as agent, not principal) within retail charter/BSP rules, and obtain board approval (VS-36)
Responsible (R): Commercial / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): COO / Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4601_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4601_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4601_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4601_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4601_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-698 (ensure controlled execution — Value-Added Service &amp; Financial Agency Product Setup &amp; Partner Contracts (PA-156.1).) | - CTL-698: strategy agency-only (legal-validated VS-100.3); insight-sized; board-approved (VS-36)
Owner: Commercial / Store Ops (VS-07) / Finance Strategy</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
