    <bpmn:process id="W_W4602" name="W4602. Bills-Payment Aggregator Partnering &amp; Biller Onboarding" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W4601); biller demand; partner review
Frequency: Per partner/biller + ongoing
Volume: Bills-payment aggregator &amp; biller network
Owner: Commercial / Procurement (VS-34) / Compliance (VS-22)
Participants: Legal (VS-100.3), IT (VS-27), Finance (VS-17), Risk (VS-21.2)
Source: workflow W4602 — Bills-Payment Aggregator Partnering &amp; Biller Onboarding</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4602_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4602_Lane1" name="Commercial">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4602_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4602_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4602_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4602_Lane2" name="Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4602_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4602_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4602_Start4" name="Strategy (W4601); biller demand; partner review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4602_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4602_Task5" name="Commercial/Procurement select the bills-payment aggregator/partner…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Commercial/Procurement select the bills-payment aggregator/partner (BSP-licensed, solvency, biller coverage — utilities, telco, government, credit cards), screened via VS-34/DD
Responsible (R): Commercial / Procurement / Compliance
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Per partner</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4602_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4602_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4602_Task6" name="Commercial/Legal contract the aggregator (agency terms, commission, settlement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Commercial/Legal contract the aggregator (agency terms, commission, settlement, liability, data/privacy, SLA), per VS-100.3, and onboard billers per coverage
Responsible (R): Commercial / Legal
Accountable (A): COO / VP Legal
Duration: Per partner</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4602_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4602_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4602_Task7" name="Compliance/Risk manage the partner lifecycle (solvency, conduct, biller…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Compliance/Risk manage the partner lifecycle (solvency, conduct, biller accuracy), renew/exit (VS-67), and ensure BSP-compliant bills-payment operation
Responsible (R): Compliance / Risk
Accountable (A): VP Legal / COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4602_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4602_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4602_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4602_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
