        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-698 (ensure controlled execution — Value-Added Service &amp; Financial Agency Product Setup &amp; Partner Contracts (PA-156.1).) | - CTL-698: aggregator BSP-licensed/solvent (VS-22); contracted w/ SLA (VS-100.3); biller accuracy validated; lifecycle managed (VS-67)
Owner: Commercial / Procurement (VS-34) / Compliance (VS-22)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
