    <bpmn:process id="W_W4604" name="W4604. Mobile Load/Top-Up &amp; Telco Partner Setup" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W4601); telco partner
Frequency: Per partner + ongoing
Volume: Telco load/top-up partner network
Owner: Commercial / Procurement (VS-34) / IT (VS-27)
Participants: Compliance (VS-22), Finance (VS-17), Stores (VS-07)
Source: workflow W4604 — Mobile Load/Top-Up &amp; Telco Partner Setup</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4604_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4604_Lane1" name="Commercial">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4604_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4604_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4604_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4604_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4604_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4604_Start3" name="Strategy (W4601); telco partner">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4604_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4604_Task4" name="Commercial/Procurement select telco load partners (Globe/Smart/Sun direct or…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Commercial/Procurement select telco load partners (Globe/Smart/Sun direct or via aggregator), screened for licensure/coverage/commission
Responsible (R): Commercial / Procurement
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Per partner</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4604_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4604_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4604_Task5" name="Commercial/IT contract &amp; integrate the load platform (real-time top-up…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Commercial/IT contract &amp; integrate the load platform (real-time top-up, commission, settlement), per VS-100.3/VS-27
