    <bpmn:process id="W_W4608" name="W4608. VAS Systems, Integration &amp; Data-Architecture Setup" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Integration need (W4602–W4604); systems design
Frequency: Per lifecycle + continuous
Volume: One VAS systems/integration landscape
Owner: IT (VS-27) / EA (VS-113) / Commercial
Participants: Data (VS-28), Security (VS-27.3), Privacy (VS-91), Finance (VS-17)
Source: workflow W4608 — VAS Systems, Integration &amp; Data-Architecture Setup</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4608_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4608_Lane1" name="IT">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4608_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4608_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4608_Lane2" name="Security">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4608_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4608_Lane3" name="Data">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4608_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4608_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4608_Start5" name="Integration need (W4602–W4604); systems design">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4608_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4608_Task6" name="IT/EA design the VAS systems architecture (counter POS/VAS terminal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: IT/EA design the VAS systems architecture (counter POS/VAS terminal, aggregator/principal integration, settlement/reconciliation, GL posting), per VS-113
Responsible (R): IT / EA / Commercial
Accountable (A): CIO / COO
Duration: Per lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4608_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4608_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4608_Task7" name="Security/Privacy ensure transaction-data security (encryption, secure principal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Security/Privacy ensure transaction-data security (encryption, secure principal exchange) per VS-27.3 and data privacy (customer PII, KYC data VS-91 RA 10173)
Responsible (R): Security / Privacy / IT
Accountable (A): CIO / DPO
Duration: Per lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4608_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4608_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4608_Task8" name="Data/Finance build VAS analytics (transactions, commission, footfall…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Data/Finance build VAS analytics (transactions, commission, footfall, basket-linkage) on the platform (VS-28), with data governance/retention (VS-88)
Responsible (R): Data / Finance / IT
Accountable (A): CIO / CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4608_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4608_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4608_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4608_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4608_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-698 (ensure controlled execution — Value-Added Service &amp; Financial Agency Product Setup &amp; Partner Contracts (PA-156.1).) | - CTL-698: architecture EA-governed (VS-113); data secured &amp; RA 10173-compliant (VS-91/VS-27.3); analytics governed (VS-28); retained per policy (VS-88)
Owner: IT (VS-27) / EA (VS-113) / Commercial</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
